# Field Requirement Conventions

Use `FieldGroup` from `~/components/ui/FieldGroup` when UI primitives exist (Phase 6).

| `requirement` | Label marker |
|---------------|--------------|
| `required` | red `*` |
| `optional` | gray `(Optional)` via `common.optional` |
| `requiredForReview` | gray via `common.requiredForReview` |

Default when omitted: `required`.

Hints describe purpose only — never repeat optional/required wording in hints.
